<title>FINLAND: Finnish July industrial production rises 5.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Finnish July industrial production rises 5.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industrial production growth adjusted for working days accelerated to 5.0 percent year-on-year in July from 4.4 percent in June, Statistics Finland (SF) said on Monday in a statement.</p>
<p>		   July 1996   June 1996   July 1995</p>
<p>		   +5.0 pct     +4.4 pct    +8.0 pct</p>
<p>Six economists' average forecast was for a growth rate of 2.2 percent (range -0.5 - +4.2 pct).</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
